{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras/name_text.png?t=1747238605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Galactic Pawns</strong> zooms into the <i>deep state</i> of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a universe full of <strong>pawns</strong>, <strong>chaos</strong> and <i>hidden agendas</i>, heroes rise from the shadows. By the order of the secret Galactic Guardian, worlds shift, villains fall and rise, and balance must be maintained... at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras/gameplay_dust.gif?t=1747238605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Welcome aboard, Agent.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a destined top-tier galactic operative, dispatched to hostile worlds to eliminate high-profile alien threats. Each mission is a test of skill, strategy, and survival. The contracts are ruthless, the enemies relentless\u2014but failure is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your skills, test a variety of weapons, and uncover ancient magical runes to enhance your abilities. Adapt, evolve, and become the ultimate agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blend in, strike fast, and vanish without a trace. The fate of the galaxy is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to restore order from the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras/gameplay_gif2.gif?t=1747238605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0YOUR MISSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect valuable <strong>coins</strong> as you eliminate enemies and complete high-risk contracts across the galaxy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your earnings to <strong>upgrade your agent</strong>, enhancing speed, strength, and resilience to survive increasingly brutal missions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a <strong>deadly arsenal of weapons</strong>, from high-tech blasters to devastating explosives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">harness the power of <strong>ancient runes</strong> to gain supernatural abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you grow stronger, deadlier <strong>bosses</strong> will rise to challenge you, pushing your skills to the limit. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and conquer <strong>new planets</strong>, each with its own dangers, secrets, and rewards\u2014because only the most <strong>relentless</strong> agents can uncover the true chaos lurking in the stars.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Good Luck, Agent. We Are Expecting You.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566940?t=1747238605","background_raw":"h